# A feature query without i gets no reply.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "The e key is only allowed in query actions, and the feature query must have the i key set, as for any other query action."
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=q,e=T,U=1\e\\"
send "\e_Ga=q,I=5,e=T,U=1\e\\"
